<title>SWEDEN: Sweden sets auction of 4.5 bln Skr of T-bills.</title>
<headline>Sweden sets auction of 4.5 bln Skr of T-bills.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's National Debt Office said on Wednesday it would invite bids from the market for an auction of Treasury bills worth 4.5 billion crowns.</p>
<p>The auction will take place on May 28, it said and bids are due by 1030 GMT on Wednesday. Settlement date is May 30.</p>
<p> Maturity date		Issue volume	    Number of days</p>
<p> Aug 20, 1997		 500 million		80</p>
<p> Nov 19, 1997		 4.0 billion	     169</p>
<p>-- Birgitta Forsberg, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1017</p>
